\
Tone: warm, playful. Independent maker meets urban culture \'97 not a\
leisure operator.\
\
Site structure\
\
This is a multi-page site, built to expand. Core pages (Home, About,\
Partner With Us) stay fixed. Each town or city gets its own page\
combining its locations and its trail, and that page is built to grow\
\'97 starting with Bristol (pop up in Anchor Square and Millennium\
Square), with room to add more Bristol sites and further towns and\
cities over time.\
\
We would like to be able to add video content to pages when we have it\
and be able to easily access and amend copy, pics, video content on\
all pages.\
\
